id: pm-review-comment-readiness
title: Expose comment-only pending bot reviews in review readiness
description: "On PR1623 the reviews-phase watcher returned a settled check inventory with no pending checks while the CodeRabbit conversation explicitly said review in progress after a requested full review. The watcher delegates only to gh pr checks, so a reviewer that reports progress solely in comments is absent from readiness. Preserve the shipped fail-fast checks phase and distinguish check completion from bot review completion."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-29T08:44:52.136Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-29T18:07:42.902Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: Reproduce a terminal check rollup with an in-progress bot conversation marker; Retain exact-head check provenance and explicit reviewer limitations; Document a bounded event-driven or operator continuation without duplicate triggers or busy polling
parent: pm-obq2
risk: medium
confidence: high
expected_result: Review readiness explicitly reports pending or unavailable comment-only reviewers and never implies their completion from a terminal check rollup.
