  "2026-10-29T08:44:52.136Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete all-status corpus plus current open/in_progress lists and review search; full live pm-jm7m3o confirms its check-based fail-fast/reviews-phase change is closed and shipped. New evidence is PR1623 at2016f0e68: requested full review is processing in a comment while watch reports pendingChecks empty. Intake only; open and unclaimed."
  "2026-10-29T18:07:42.901Z","harness:codex","Fresh PR1623 evidence: the emitted CodeRabbit check was green/skipped while its comment-only full review remained in progress after17:22. The finished17:38 review posted actionable inline4415799522, discovered through the complete conversation inventory and retained under pm-native-index-proof. A check-only pass must not certify comment-only reviewer completion. Keep this existing enhancement open and unclaimed; no duplicate intake was created."
